<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's PSBR drops in Jan-March '97.</title>
<headline>Portugal's PSBR drops in Jan-March '97.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's public sector borrowing requirement (PSBR) dropped in the period from January to March 1997 to 449.6 billion escudos from 559.6 billion in the same year-ago period, the Bank of Portugal said in a monthly report.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
